    "text": "By Lenore Fedow ,\n1 days ago Springfield, Va.—Police in Fairfax County, Virginia, are on the lookout for four suspects connected to the armed robbery of a jewelry store. Officers responded to reports of a robbery at Dubai Jewelers in Springfield, Virginia, on Sunday, Sept. 27 around 3:30 p.m. The store specializes in high-karat (21- and 22-karat) gold jewelry for weddings. Read full article\n3",
